WEBVTT

00:07.782 --> 00:13.542
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.142 --> 00:19.732
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha

00:19.772 --> 00:28.322
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.322 --> 00:30.192
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.472 --> 00:34.022
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.352 --> 00:37.852
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.352 --> 00:40.692
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.692 --> 00:45.442
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.572 --> 00:48.782
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.742 --> 00:51.742
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.292 --> 01:01.002
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.332 --> 01:03.342
...with you.
futaride

01:04.342 --> 01:10.052
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.722 --> 01:16.142
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.352 --> 01:24.782
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.782 --> 01:26.482
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:34.302 --> 01:35.222
It's so good!

01:35.222 --> 01:37.302
You eat a lot even in the morning.

01:37.302 --> 01:40.552
Because Kozue-chan's cooking is so good.

01:42.772 --> 01:45.062
Of course it is.

01:45.062 --> 01:49.692
It's too good for you, Momono-san, so I will eat it for you.

01:50.732 --> 01:52.402
Not so fast!

01:53.992 --> 01:56.242
My fish!

01:56.242 --> 01:58.662
You have improved.

01:59.032 --> 01:59.742
Yeah!

01:59.742 --> 02:00.242
Let it go!

02:00.242 --> 02:01.072
Do it!

02:01.082 --> 02:02.662
Would you both please stop?

02:02.662 --> 02:04.122
We're still eating.

02:04.122 --> 02:06.122
You think you are good enough?

02:07.712 --> 02:09.422
No way, my fish!
Let it go, Momo-san!

02:09.422 --> 02:09.752
Let it go, Momo-san!

02:09.752 --> 02:11.132
I wonder if Asami-chan and Sayoko-san are eating breakfast?
Let it go, Momo-san!

02:11.132 --> 02:13.592
I wonder if Asami-chan and Sayoko-san are eating breakfast?

02:15.672 --> 02:17.052
Kozue-chan...

02:19.012 --> 02:20.262
I'm sure they are.

02:20.262 --> 02:22.182
They said it's a hotel-like place,

02:22.182 --> 02:24.222
so I'm sure they are stuffed by now.

02:24.222 --> 02:25.972
I guess so.

02:25.982 --> 02:29.772
It might be really comfortable there; they might not come back.

02:29.772 --> 02:30.482
Momo-san!

02:32.112 --> 02:34.522
I'm just saying that it's possible.

02:35.032 --> 02:36.652
Is that your sixth sense?

02:36.652 --> 02:38.612
Nothing like that.

02:38.612 --> 02:40.032
If you think about it,

02:40.032 --> 02:42.782
they are always busy with their work.

02:43.122 --> 02:44.202
Pudding!
Pudding

02:44.202 --> 02:44.282
Pudding!

02:44.542 --> 02:44.582
Yokan.

02:44.582 --> 02:45.872
Yokan
Yokan.

02:45.872 --> 02:46.082
Yokan.

02:46.202 --> 02:47.162
Yay!

02:47.162 --> 02:50.622
And they live for pudding and yokan.

02:51.292 --> 02:53.042
Would they come back?

02:53.042 --> 02:54.502
Momo-san!

02:57.842 --> 03:00.752
I don't mean this is a bad place!

03:00.752 --> 03:00.762
OK?
I don't mean this is a bad place!

03:00.762 --> 03:01.892
OK?

03:01.892 --> 03:03.972
I think they will come back.

03:04.352 --> 03:08.062
Because we have such delicious miso soup here.

03:08.062 --> 03:11.982
Also, Kozue-chan's freshly-cooked rice and energy-filled umeboshi.

03:12.482 --> 03:15.572
I would definitely come back.

03:18.952 --> 03:20.492
Kozue-chan, can I have seconds?

03:20.742 --> 03:21.702
Sure!

03:22.242 --> 03:24.992
Kozue-chan, I want seconds too.

03:24.992 --> 03:26.832
I want more rice.

03:26.832 --> 03:28.832
Me too.

03:28.832 --> 03:29.702
OK!

03:31.152 --> 03:34.982
Precious...

03:36.072 --> 03:38.662
Did Mom wake up by herself?

03:43.082 --> 03:44.542
Good morning.

03:45.752 --> 03:47.082
Good morning.

03:47.372 --> 03:50.582
Um, do you know where Mom is?

03:50.592 --> 03:51.922
Sayoko Ojo-sama?

03:52.882 --> 03:54.922
She is already awake.

03:54.922 --> 03:57.132
She is?

03:57.132 --> 03:59.552
She got up before me.

03:59.552 --> 04:01.642
Breakfast is ready.

04:01.642 --> 04:02.852
This way, please.

04:02.852 --> 04:04.182
Yes.

04:07.482 --> 04:09.902
Wow, it's a huge meal!

04:09.902 --> 04:11.352
Are we celebrating something?

04:12.612 --> 04:14.112
You are overreacting.

04:14.112 --> 04:16.612
No, I'm not.

04:16.612 --> 04:18.112
Just eat.

04:18.242 --> 04:20.352
Let's eat!

04:21.602 --> 04:22.262
What's wrong?

04:22.282 --> 04:23.702
Is there something you don't like?

04:23.702 --> 04:24.692
No.

04:26.062 --> 04:26.812
Um...

04:27.162 --> 04:29.062
Do you know where Mom is?

04:29.672 --> 04:32.502
Sayoko Ojo-sama?

04:33.382 --> 04:34.542
<i>Do you understand?</i>

04:34.552 --> 04:37.012
<i>Don't let Sayoko Ojo-sama and
Asami-sama get close to each other.</i>

04:37.262 --> 04:38.382
<i>Why?</i>

04:38.672 --> 04:40.302
<i>It's the Master's order.</i>

04:41.432 --> 04:42.642
<i>If you fail,</i>

04:43.142 --> 04:43.892
<i>be ready.</i>

04:44.012 --> 04:47.272
Sayoko Ojo-sama has already eaten.

04:47.272 --> 04:48.942
I see.

04:49.022 --> 04:51.522
Sayoko Ojo-sama has already eaten.

05:05.162 --> 05:08.082
<i>I haven't seen Mom since yesterday.</i>

05:11.372 --> 05:13.832
Futabadai Second Junior High

05:15.172 --> 05:17.342
Miss, have a nice day.

05:17.342 --> 05:19.762
Thank you for the ride.

05:19.762 --> 05:23.052
That's quite a change for Asami.

05:23.052 --> 05:24.222
Impossible!

05:24.222 --> 05:27.262
How can Kurosuke-san have a ride to school?

05:27.392 --> 05:28.052
Good morning, Asami.

05:28.052 --> 05:28.812
This must be a bad dream.
Good morning, Asami.

05:28.812 --> 05:29.852
Good morning.
This must be a bad dream.

05:29.852 --> 05:29.982
I must wake up.
Good morning.

05:29.982 --> 05:31.732
I must wake up.

05:33.772 --> 05:35.402
Thank you, Tachibana.

05:39.922 --> 05:42.782
About the talk we had yesterday, did you think about it?

05:43.162 --> 05:45.372
You must be at a loss.

05:45.372 --> 05:47.782
You are worried about your girl, right?

05:48.122 --> 05:49.292
About Asami.

05:50.662 --> 05:53.832
There is a couple I like in our neighborhood.

05:53.832 --> 05:56.792
They are trustworthy, great people.

05:56.792 --> 05:59.382
I'm thinking about giving her to them to raise.

05:59.382 --> 06:00.302
Ushimitsu-san?!

06:00.802 --> 06:03.552
After you remarry, you will eventually have your own children.

06:03.552 --> 06:06.222
What would she think then?

06:06.222 --> 06:10.562
Wouldn't she feel uncomfortable?

06:10.892 --> 06:15.522
Even if you love her and your child equally,

06:15.522 --> 06:19.572
would she be able to accept the love unconditionally?

06:19.822 --> 06:23.072
I am the only member of the family without a blood relation.

06:23.072 --> 06:25.492
Am I supposed to be here?

06:25.492 --> 06:27.872
Am I being a nuisance?

06:29.202 --> 06:34.712
No matter how much love you pour into her, that love will not reach her.

06:34.712 --> 06:38.082
Would such a situation be worth calling happiness?

06:38.092 --> 06:42.422
This is the solution I came up with after putting much consideration into many things.

06:42.422 --> 06:43.842
Please accept it.

06:45.222 --> 06:48.512
Even after you give her away, she will still be close enough to see her often.

06:48.852 --> 06:51.352
You will remarry and be happy.

06:51.352 --> 06:54.772
She will be cared for by foster parents and be happy.

06:54.772 --> 06:57.522
We will be able to hold our grandchildren and be happy.

06:57.522 --> 07:00.612
We will be happy and everything will turn out well.

07:05.032 --> 07:07.742
<i>I wonder what Mom is doing?</i>

07:21.842 --> 07:24.802
<i>I wonder how everyone is doing?</i>

07:59.632 --> 08:01.502
Please give me seven Obanyaki.

08:01.502 --> 08:02.252
Sure.

08:04.172 --> 08:05.922
I'm sorry, actually, five.

08:05.922 --> 08:08.262
What? You want five?

08:08.552 --> 08:09.632
Yum.

08:10.472 --> 08:12.802
Actually, I'll take seven.

08:12.982 --> 08:14.802
Supermarket

08:20.402 --> 08:21.852
Kozue-chan,

08:21.862 --> 08:23.692
we have a new brand of wieners.

08:23.692 --> 08:24.482
Come try one!

08:24.782 --> 08:26.232
Wieners?

08:26.232 --> 08:27.032
Yup.

08:27.032 --> 08:28.572
Try one.

08:28.572 --> 08:30.242
Where is Asami-chan?

08:31.032 --> 08:32.952
She is not with me today.

08:32.952 --> 08:34.242
That's too bad.

08:34.242 --> 08:37.122
Anything she says is good sells well.

08:37.122 --> 08:38.412
I know.

08:49.132 --> 08:50.512
Yum.

08:51.932 --> 08:53.222
Kozue-chan.

08:53.222 --> 08:54.762
Shiratori-san.

08:57.222 --> 08:59.772
So you did too.

08:59.772 --> 09:03.862
Yeah, I bought stuff for Asami-chan and Sayoko-san too.

09:08.032 --> 09:12.202
What I took for granted was special.

09:13.162 --> 09:18.582
Being around everyone at Narutakisou every day is fun and happy.

09:18.582 --> 09:21.712
I thought those days would last forever.

09:21.712 --> 09:26.842
But Sayoko-san and Asami-chan are gone right now, and...

09:27.882 --> 09:29.262
They will come back.

09:30.512 --> 09:32.052
Shiratori-san...

09:32.632 --> 09:34.182
It will be fine.

09:35.552 --> 09:36.352
Yes!

09:36.892 --> 09:37.972
It will be, right?

09:37.972 --> 09:38.852
Yup.

09:38.852 --> 09:42.772
I usually have good instincts on these things.

09:44.482 --> 09:47.772
I guess... instincts aren't good enough.

09:49.652 --> 09:51.742
That's not true.

09:51.742 --> 09:54.702
I believe in your instincts.

09:55.372 --> 09:58.332
I'm sure they will come back.

09:58.832 --> 09:59.492
Yup.

10:09.212 --> 10:11.922
<i>It's all for the sake of your future,</i>

10:12.802 --> 10:14.092
<i>Sayoko.</i>

10:24.652 --> 10:27.192
Thank you for the ride, Mr. Driver.

10:27.192 --> 10:27.902
No problem.

10:27.902 --> 10:28.772
See you again.

10:33.402 --> 10:35.112
It's pudding!

10:35.492 --> 10:37.532
Go ahead, Asami-san.

10:37.532 --> 10:39.952
We have a Minazuki family specialty cake too.

10:39.952 --> 10:41.702
Where is Mom?

10:42.122 --> 10:44.712
She has eaten already.

10:44.712 --> 10:46.502
Then what is she doing now?

10:46.502 --> 10:49.292
She is taking a nap.

10:49.292 --> 10:50.632
Where?

10:50.632 --> 10:53.302
In her room.

10:53.842 --> 10:55.472
I see.

10:56.802 --> 10:57.592
Anyway, go ahead...

10:57.592 --> 10:59.802
I wonder if Tachibana-san would know?
Anyway, go ahead...

11:00.852 --> 11:02.812
Please forgive me.

11:02.812 --> 11:08.022
Just please leave this subject alone.

11:10.062 --> 11:11.902
Where is Mom?

11:12.152 --> 11:14.572
I wonder where Mom is?

11:15.862 --> 11:17.152
Mom?

11:19.122 --> 11:21.242
Excuse me.

11:21.782 --> 11:23.372
Where is Mom?

11:24.622 --> 11:25.832
Mom?

11:27.792 --> 11:29.542
This is... uh...

11:29.542 --> 11:31.422
Excuse me.

11:31.832 --> 11:33.172
Where is Mom?

11:34.422 --> 11:35.672
Mom?

11:36.052 --> 11:37.382
Let me out!

11:37.382 --> 11:39.052
Excuse me!

11:45.432 --> 11:47.142
<i>Where is my sister?</i>

11:47.692 --> 11:49.152
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

11:49.812 --> 11:53.902
<i>Ojo-sama is having an important talk with Master right now.</i>

11:58.412 --> 11:59.492
How boring.

12:08.832 --> 12:10.122
Mom?

12:13.382 --> 12:14.632
Mahiru-chan.

12:16.092 --> 12:17.132
I see.

12:17.132 --> 12:20.052
You don't know where Mom is.

12:20.972 --> 12:23.392
Tachibana wouldn't let me see her.

12:25.222 --> 12:27.272
She said it was Dad's order.

12:30.852 --> 12:31.902
Good catch.

12:31.902 --> 12:32.692
Good job.

12:34.692 --> 12:37.942
Is it okay for me to be here?

12:40.912 --> 12:41.612
Why?

12:42.532 --> 12:45.952
Because I'm not Mom's real daughter.

12:46.752 --> 12:47.872
Really?

12:47.872 --> 12:52.082
My real mom died soon after I was born.

12:52.792 --> 12:58.132
My dad died soon after he eloped with Mom.

12:59.842 --> 13:02.682
So I was thinking that Grandpa...

13:02.682 --> 13:09.272
...wasn't thinking well about him or me.

13:10.142 --> 13:13.102
I'm sorry for talking about it...

13:15.362 --> 13:17.652
What's wrong, Mahiru-chan?

13:17.652 --> 13:19.152
Did you sprain your finger?

13:19.152 --> 13:21.492
Imagining it made me sad.

13:22.322 --> 13:27.082
If Mom and Dad died, I...

13:27.082 --> 13:27.952
I...

13:28.752 --> 13:31.212
Please don't cry, Mahiru-chan!

13:34.582 --> 13:36.462
You are strong.

13:36.462 --> 13:37.542
And great.

13:37.552 --> 13:38.752
That's not true.

13:39.172 --> 13:46.052
The fact that I'm living, and smiling is...

13:46.052 --> 13:47.892
...all because of Mom.

13:48.222 --> 13:50.982
So I'm a bit lonely now.

13:50.982 --> 13:53.732
By not being able to see Mom for a day,

13:54.352 --> 13:57.192
it feels like there is a big hole in my heart.

13:57.442 --> 13:59.442
I wonder what Mom is doing?

14:00.072 --> 14:01.322
I want to see her...

14:02.032 --> 14:04.072
I know how you feel.

14:04.662 --> 14:07.492
I met my sister without letting Mother know.

14:08.792 --> 14:10.202
Let's go, Asami.

14:11.912 --> 14:13.212
To Sister's place.

14:13.542 --> 14:14.792
Mahiru-chan...

14:15.542 --> 14:16.332
Yeah!

14:19.712 --> 14:21.172
Tachibana isn't here.

14:21.172 --> 14:22.092
It's our chance.

14:24.182 --> 14:25.512
Mom?

14:27.262 --> 14:28.762
Sister is not here.

14:31.022 --> 14:33.142
Oh, the husband candidates...

14:39.732 --> 14:41.032
Have you made up your mind?

14:45.572 --> 14:47.412
Of course.

14:47.412 --> 14:49.622
Mom is still young.

14:49.622 --> 14:50.282
Asami...

14:50.742 --> 14:54.912
I want her to be happier than she is now.

14:54.912 --> 14:55.792
Asami...

14:56.252 --> 14:59.132
I wonder who she will choose?

14:59.132 --> 15:02.132
I'm sure she will pick a nice person.

15:02.842 --> 15:05.802
Don't you think so too, Mahiru-chan?

15:07.342 --> 15:12.392
But will she be able to wake up in the morning and fix breakfast?

15:12.932 --> 15:15.062
If she will cook eggs sunny-side-up every morning...

15:15.062 --> 15:16.312
We will stop this wedding arrangement.

15:18.232 --> 15:21.272
This is your future life partner.

15:21.272 --> 15:23.072
You can take your time.

15:23.692 --> 15:27.572
I was head over heels the first time I saw Yu-chan!

15:27.572 --> 15:29.822
I was too!

15:32.042 --> 15:33.742
I need to talk to you.

15:34.122 --> 15:35.872
Wait, up, Mahiru-chan!

15:35.872 --> 15:37.752
You can't do that!

15:37.752 --> 15:39.962
Mahiru-chan!

15:39.962 --> 15:41.542
Is my sister in there?

15:41.542 --> 15:42.252
Yes.

15:42.252 --> 15:42.842
Let me see her.

15:43.252 --> 15:44.672
I can't allow you to.

15:44.672 --> 15:46.802
As I told you earlier.

15:46.802 --> 15:50.892
Ojo-sama is in the middle of an important conversation.

15:51.102 --> 15:53.262
Even with my order?

15:53.262 --> 15:55.182
It is Master's order.

15:55.182 --> 15:55.932
I'm sorry.

15:56.182 --> 15:58.852
Then I want you to let us hear her voice.

15:58.852 --> 16:00.352
Can we at least do that?

16:00.362 --> 16:01.232
Mahiru-chan...

16:01.652 --> 16:04.022
I was not ordered to prohibit that.

16:05.902 --> 16:06.652
Go ahead.

16:06.652 --> 16:07.612
Asami.

16:07.612 --> 16:08.702
Yeah.

16:08.702 --> 16:10.452
Thank you, Tachibana-san.

16:12.122 --> 16:12.952
Tachibana.

16:12.952 --> 16:13.662
Yes.

16:16.702 --> 16:18.002
WHAT?!

16:18.622 --> 16:19.832
What did you just say?!

16:19.832 --> 16:22.422
I will not remarry.

16:24.092 --> 16:25.342
Sayoko-san!

16:25.342 --> 16:27.092
I haven't...

16:27.092 --> 16:30.932
My feelings haven't changed since that day.

16:30.932 --> 16:31.842
So...

16:31.842 --> 16:33.012
Sayoko,

16:33.972 --> 16:37.392
are you still bound to his shadow?

16:37.392 --> 16:40.812
A dead person will never come back, no matter what.

16:41.352 --> 16:44.522
You know that the best!

16:44.522 --> 16:46.982
People have the right to be happy.

16:46.992 --> 16:48.112
And that's an obligation too!

16:48.112 --> 16:50.202
I'm not asking you to forget about him.

16:51.202 --> 16:53.452
Stop being particular about him.

16:54.122 --> 16:55.532
Make him a memory.

16:55.542 --> 16:58.452
I'm sure he's wishing for that.

16:58.452 --> 16:59.662
Do you think so?

17:00.542 --> 17:05.172
If I died first, and if he forgot about me,

17:05.172 --> 17:08.342
I would despise that.

17:08.882 --> 17:14.302
Even after I died, I would want him to love me forever.

17:14.762 --> 17:20.852
Even after I died, if he loved someone else,

17:20.852 --> 17:23.522
I would have a grudge.

17:23.522 --> 17:24.602
I would curse him.

17:26.402 --> 17:27.942
Mom...

17:27.942 --> 17:29.572
Sister sounds scary.

17:29.992 --> 17:32.742
There is only one man I love in my life.

17:33.612 --> 17:35.162
Only him.

17:35.742 --> 17:39.832
It hasn't changed, and will never change.

17:41.332 --> 17:44.292
To me, "love" means that kind of love.

17:45.132 --> 17:49.632
Others might say that that's wrong,

17:49.632 --> 17:52.552
but to me, that's the only way I can live.

17:53.472 --> 17:56.852
So I will not remarry.

17:57.142 --> 17:59.012
That's absurd!

17:59.022 --> 18:03.732
Have you been happy all this time, dragging his memories along?!

18:04.192 --> 18:08.612
Sure, after I lost him, the days have been harsh,

18:08.612 --> 18:10.732
and I wished I could die many times.

18:11.822 --> 18:13.992
But I'm happy that I'm alive.

18:14.492 --> 18:16.452
That's because of her.

18:16.992 --> 18:18.872
Because Asami is around.

18:19.452 --> 18:23.252
If she wasn't around, I would have been long dead.

18:23.752 --> 18:25.832
She is my reason to live,

18:26.132 --> 18:28.342
and she is the precious daughter between him and I.

18:29.342 --> 18:30.842
To be apart from her...

18:31.882 --> 18:33.972
A life without her...

18:36.012 --> 18:37.512
That's unthinkable.

18:38.012 --> 18:40.352
Is that also a part of the reason you don't want to remarry?

18:40.892 --> 18:43.892
Did you know that she is not...

18:43.892 --> 18:47.062
Asami is not Kurosaki's real daughter?!

18:47.312 --> 18:48.022
Ushimitsu-san!

18:50.692 --> 18:51.822
What...?

18:52.692 --> 18:55.952
Asami is an adopted child with no real relation to Kurosaki.

18:56.532 --> 19:01.082
She has nothing to do with the man you love, Kurosaki.

19:01.082 --> 19:02.242
Ushimitsu-san!

19:02.792 --> 19:05.122
I know that.

19:06.422 --> 19:10.462
He told me that he adopted her.

19:10.462 --> 19:11.752
So what?

19:12.092 --> 19:15.592
Whether there is a blood relation between him and Asami or not,

19:16.262 --> 19:17.882
she is his.

19:18.722 --> 19:22.392
Asami is his daughter, and my daughter.

19:22.952 --> 19:26.482
She calls me Mom.

19:27.442 --> 19:29.232
Mom!

19:29.862 --> 19:31.572
Mom!

19:32.232 --> 19:33.482
Mom!

19:37.322 --> 19:38.322
Mom...

19:38.322 --> 19:43.912
Each time she calls me Mom, it makes me happy.

19:44.702 --> 19:46.962
I feel fuzzy in my stomach.

19:46.962 --> 19:48.872
Fuzzy?

19:48.872 --> 19:52.672
Kurosaki Asami is my daughter.

19:52.672 --> 19:55.882
Just to live my love for him,

19:56.672 --> 19:59.382
it is a feeling that will never change.

19:59.762 --> 20:01.972
Is that all you have to say?!

20:02.392 --> 20:03.562
Ushimitsu-san!

20:04.312 --> 20:06.642
You've been making only selfish claims!

20:07.482 --> 20:10.312
Have you ever thought about how she feels?!

20:10.312 --> 20:13.732
She is having a trouble-free life right now.

20:13.732 --> 20:17.532
Would she want to go back to that miserable,

20:17.532 --> 20:20.952
shabby life, giving up this one?!

20:21.622 --> 20:23.122
How about that, Sayoko?!

20:24.742 --> 20:25.162
M...

20:26.502 --> 20:27.502
Mo...

20:28.372 --> 20:29.832
What...

20:29.832 --> 20:30.752
Asami.

20:31.002 --> 20:32.882
I...

20:32.882 --> 20:35.172
I love Mom!

20:40.222 --> 20:42.842
It's fun being with Mom.

20:42.852 --> 20:44.802
And I'm happy.

20:44.812 --> 20:49.232
She sleeps a lot, and sometimes slacks off on her work.

20:49.232 --> 20:52.402
And we don't have yummy meals like we do here.

20:52.772 --> 20:55.902
But the cup noodles we eat together are more delicious!

20:56.612 --> 20:59.822
I want to be with Mom!

20:59.822 --> 21:02.912
All I want is to be with Mom!

21:06.292 --> 21:07.202
Asami.

21:10.042 --> 21:11.502
Mom!

21:13.292 --> 21:15.342
Father, Mother,

21:16.052 --> 21:18.302
thank you for all your consideration,

21:18.842 --> 21:23.092
but I will live alone with her.

21:23.342 --> 21:25.722
I am really sorry.

21:27.642 --> 21:28.892
Suit yourself!

21:28.892 --> 21:31.812
If that's your choice, then fine!

21:31.812 --> 21:34.062
Live according to your will!

21:34.692 --> 21:35.652
Get out!

21:36.612 --> 21:38.192
But Ushimitsu-san!

21:39.112 --> 21:40.692
Let's go, Asami.

21:42.402 --> 21:43.612
Sayoko-san!

21:43.612 --> 21:45.072
After you do that,

21:46.742 --> 21:50.832
if you ever get tired, you can come back anytime.

21:52.582 --> 21:53.252
Yes.

22:00.972 --> 22:04.722
That timid girl is now stating her own will.

22:04.722 --> 22:07.012
She has gotten strong.

22:07.012 --> 22:09.142
People do change.

22:09.142 --> 22:10.432
You too.

22:12.142 --> 22:15.652
You have been concerned about her all this time.

22:17.022 --> 22:19.522
Every parent cares about his children.

22:19.532 --> 22:22.992
Thank you for forgiving her selfishness.

22:23.742 --> 22:24.782
Stop that!

22:25.912 --> 22:27.912
Are you sure about this, Mom?

22:27.912 --> 22:28.622
Yes.

22:29.492 --> 22:31.042
Come visit us again anytime.

22:31.042 --> 22:32.702
I will play with you anytime.

22:32.712 --> 22:33.832
Don't hold back.

22:33.832 --> 22:35.212
Thank you.

22:35.212 --> 22:37.042
You can come to us anytime too.

22:37.962 --> 22:39.252
Are you sure?

22:39.252 --> 22:40.042
Of course!

22:40.342 --> 22:41.252
Good.

22:42.012 --> 22:44.802
I can see Sister without any constraints from now on.

22:44.802 --> 22:46.302
And I can play with you too.

22:47.222 --> 22:48.852
Narutakisou...

22:48.852 --> 22:50.342
...that is a great place.

22:54.692 --> 22:56.942
OK, Ojo-sama, we are here.

23:02.902 --> 23:04.112
Asami-chan!

23:04.112 --> 23:05.362
Sayoko-san!

23:05.362 --> 23:06.952
Kozue Onee-chan.

23:06.952 --> 23:08.322
Tamami Onee-chan.

23:08.322 --> 23:09.742
Shiratori Onii-chan.

23:09.742 --> 23:10.782
Momono-san.

23:10.782 --> 23:12.542
Haibara-san and Johnny...

23:12.542 --> 23:13.752
Everyone...

23:14.622 --> 23:16.042
...we are home!

23:16.712 --> 23:18.502
Welcome home!

23:29.452 --> 23:35.962
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

23:36.042 --> 23:41.762
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

23:43.182 --> 23:49.642
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

23:49.892 --> 23:54.942
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

23:56.902 --> 24:03.652
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

24:03.902 --> 24:09.582
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

24:10.582 --> 24:16.422
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

24:16.422 --> 24:18.672
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

24:18.882 --> 24:25.052
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

24:25.552 --> 24:31.392
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

24:31.392 --> 24:36.022
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

24:52.012 --> 24:52.262
The Next Episode Preview Corner

24:52.262 --> 24:56.182
I'm glad Sayoko-san and Asami-chan made it back safely.
The Next Episode Preview Corner

